{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269VIYtX8laG1795499238.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>不少人喜歡養寵物鳥，河北邯鄲有人受到啟發，辭職創業，訓練出受市場歡迎的聽話小鳥。</p><p></p><p>推磨盤，取物、置物一樣輕鬆做到。鳥兒與馴鳥人李建剛配合默契。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PIC J.HB.PETBIRD.1115-HOLD_CLEAN_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026PvydUjG5oy1795499226.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>馴鳥人李建剛表示：「馴鳥的主要技巧就是控食，根據鳥的體型還有體質，來決定控食的時間。鳥餓了，我用食物引導牠完成動作，對了獎勵，錯了不獎勵。不能打罵，口令要清晰，手勢明確，要循序漸進，不能急於速成。要堅持手餵，多互動。這樣下來，鳥會越來越親人、越來越聽話。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PIC J.HB.PETBIRD.1115-HOLD_CLEAN_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ooex07QOn11795499194.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>住在河北邯鄲的李建剛，自幼喜歡養鳥，看到別人馴鳥覺得有趣，便開始鑽研馴鳥技巧，兩年多前更辭去穩定工作，自行創業，專職從事馴鳥。如今他的技藝越來越成熟，馴出的鳥深受市場歡迎。</p><p></p><p>李建剛稱：「我在網上給大夥講解馴鳥技巧，展示馴鳥成果。不少人都抱著試試看的心態下單。這些客戶領回鳥後，對我訓練成果非常滿意。通過口口相傳，我的客源不斷增多，年收入遠高於上班時候的收入。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PIC J.HB.PETBIRD.1115-HOLD_CLEAN_4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EMNUZP91Wq1795499207.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>他下一步計劃開班收徒，擴大馴鳥技藝的影響力。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:45:15.119267+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":404,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T05:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T10:37:15.630820+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:38:33.516596+00:00","content_hash":"a2de1495ade70576d1539baf65b3bc0668e08c29bd29e41d73f8211b1eef0bbb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:45:15.119267+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}